  <data name="TU_PrivacyDescription1.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>LiteClinic uses SQLite as its local database, which does not include built-in user authentication or password protection. Users are fully responsible for safeguarding their data and ensuring it remains secure.</value>
    <comment>TU_PrivacyDescription1</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="TU_PrivacyDescription2.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>We strongly recommend maintaining proper security on your device, such as using antivirus software, firewalls, and regular system updates.</value>
    <comment>TU_PrivacyDescription2</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="TU_PrivacyDescription3.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>LiteClinic uses a Telegram bot only for sending notifications; the bot token must never be shared or exposed to others. For additional safety, the Telegram bot token is encrypted inside the app.</value>
    <comment>TU_PrivacyDescription3</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="TU_PrivacyDescription4.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Users are responsible for keeping their system environment secure, restricting access to their PC, and backing up their data regularly to prevent unauthorized access or data loss.</value>
    <comment>TU_PrivacyDescription4</comment>
  </data>
